cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying article below."
title: "asr-finetune: parameter-efficient fine-tuning of Whisper for oral-history ASR"
abstract: >-
  Code for parameter-efficient fine-tuning of OpenAI Whisper using LoRA/DoRA
  adapters, with Bayesian hyper-parameter optimization (Optuna TPE + ASHA on Ray
  Tune) and a baseline-corrected per-shard WER objective.
type: software
authors:
